EdTBMl&_nc_oc=Ado9Z52RjU4CaKCfm6CnB7nj-2IHJ2OUVI2AHMuPokvsOHJEuyCOfTeIw3JnraZGd20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTjGvL4wq9rfzesuHkLSxGdc0HTfAyiBeJYepYXtwmNsg&oe=6B05AF0B"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "134778495298719", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982471_134778498632052_411711373724603695_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XmR1MuuOjFsQ7kNvwGz8ul4&_nc_oc=AdoBkY9_isNzDAVV3OgQ7Bb2USbjcoq2C6ldo3YOSL4ZQMn4-6elADX6mez9b7lCvRg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQZYTXMEsjbyFb6KnsSXpiKRU4npzZySb8qfoNpezf7aQ&oe=6B05BDE4"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "798605747754490", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982483_798605754421156_1986649763789961237_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HBJGE30S8QMQ7kNvwHx0HYZ&_nc_oc=AdqxAwpTn_ozT7qdXOGhF3Nyxu7KOPPX9MGIyaBEAM-x6bZsJj_bK-WdA94JWsix7NE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTv--ftNgaPJg_e_XKjPglttS9NJ29Kc3Jd4ML6v6q-1w&oe=6B05D7A5"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "263294812157372", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035358_263294815490705_4150129998500296228_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QQbqb-MJDPQQ7kNvwGeDxEo&_nc_oc=AdqNGnTB7z9qSzODs82TgtXfb48B9IZZeNYk_ckOAkUEHpQ88gtge3JQbspR3eMj6Ns&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTgZLzP3-_FaTo2SJQMVVYIjyTg3e-UjMBTQzK5-fVghg&oe=6B05B227"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Modulia Quest - screenshot.png", "id": "522084335580003", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982449_522084338913336_7694930828877611739_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dx9BvGX_o5MQ7kNvwHWd32X&_nc_oc=AdrOopWLoul8AiDBRw3QTSbFpntbeeYbN_dtHkcdcac0PfHAxD35vx8A146QCI7iCU8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQeihyVF3cxD-G28eRy9NQPyLWrIpf1ngYuD5ixUOXVig&oe=6B05A311"}, "display_name": "Modulia Studio", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Modulia Studio is a VR MIDI controller. \n\nIt allows you to wirelessly control any MIDI-compatible software and has an especially deep integration with Ableton Live\u2122 10 & 11. It also features a standalone mode with embedded sounds.\n\nBuild your custom studio using the 11 different modules:\n\n- Session (controls the session view of Live\u2122)\n- Circular Keyboard (a beautiful 360\u00b0 keyboard)\n- Scale Keyboard (a versatile scaled keyboard)\n- Expressive Keyboard (a MIDI-MPE keyboard for expressive performances)\n- Remote (remotely triggers multiple notes and visual effects at once)\n- Pads (a 4x4 pads grid)\n- Cube Mixer (a 3D mixing space)\n- Cylinder Mixer (a cylindrical 3D mixing space)\n- Knobs (4 configurable knobs)\n- Sliders (4 configurable sliders)\n- FX (visual effects)\n\nDownload Modulia Desktop for MacOS and Windows to connect Modulia Studio to your MIDI software: www.modulia-studio.com/get-modulia-studio/#desktop \n\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nAbleton\u00ae and Live\u2122 are trademarks of Ableton AG.", "short_description": "Modulia Studio is a VR MIDI controller. \n\nIt lets you wirelessly control any MIDI-compatible software and has a deep integration with Ableton Live\u2122 10 & 11. It also features a standalone mode with embedded sounds.\n\nBuild your studio using the 11 different modules:\n\n- Session\n- Circular Keyboard\n- Scale Keyboard\n- Expressive Keyboard\n- Remote\n- Pads\n- Cube Mixer\n- Cylinder Mixer\n- Knobs\n- Sliders\n- FX\n\nGet Modulia Desktop to connect Modulia Studio to your MIDI software at www.modulia-studio.com "}]}, "developer_name": "Th\u00e9r\u00e9mix Tech", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.modulia-studio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Th\u00e9r\u00e9mix Tech", "support_website_url": 